ials',status:'completed'},{title:'Appearance: Lustre and Non-Lustrous Materials',status:'completed'},{title:'Hardness and Softness Testing',status:'in_progress',progressPercent:45},{title:'Solubility in Water: Soluble vs Insoluble',status:'locked'},{title:'Transparency: Transparent, Opaque & Translucent',status:'locked'}]},{chapter:'Chapter 3: Separation of Substances',description:'Methods of separation: handpicking, threshing, winnowing, sieving, sedimentation, decantation, filtration, and evaporation.',topics:[{title:'Handpicking, Threshing and Winnowing',status:'completed'},{title:'Sieving and Magnetic Separation',status:'completed'},{title:'Sedimentation, Decantation & Filtration',status:'in_progress',progressPercent:50},{title:'Evaporation and Condensation',status:'locked'},{title:'Saturated Solutions and Solubility Limits',status:'locked'}]},{chapter:'Chapter 4: Getting to Know Plants',description:'Herbs, shrubs, trees, structure of root systems, stem transport, leaf venation, flowers, and pollination.',topics:[{title:'Classification: Herbs, Shrubs and Trees',status:'completed'},{title:'Stem: Conduction of Water and Minerals',status:'completed'},{title:'Leaf: Parts, Venation & Transpiration',status:'in_progress',progressPercent:55},{title:'Roots: Taproot and Fibrous Root Systems',status:'locked'},{title:'Flower Structure: Sepals, Petals, Stamens, Pistil',status:'locked'}]},{chapter:'Chapter 5: Body Movements',description:'Human skeletal system, joints (ball & socket, hinge, pivotal), cartilage, muscles, and gait of animals (earthworm, bird, fish).',topics:[{title:'Human Skeleton, Bones and Cartilage',status:'completed'},{title:'Types of Joints (Ball & Socket, Hinge, Pivotal)',status:'completed'},{title:'Muscle Contraction and Movement',status:'in_progress',progressPercent:40},{title:'Gait of Animals: Earthworm, Snail & Cockroach',status:'locked'},{title:'Fish Swimming & Bird Flight Adaptations',status:'locked'}]},{chapter:'Chapter 6: The Living Organisms \u201